"{\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"I’d investigate the Aeroplan economy itinerary via Hong Kong first: among these shown awards, it arrives earlier than the other late-departing option below and has lower observed fees than the Taiwan-routing alternatives. If arriving early is more important, consider the earlier-departing Hong Kong itinerary instead.\"},{\"k\":\"p\",\"r\":\"J1@2027-01-15T23:15-08:00/SFO>BKK/E>2027-01-17T10:35\",\"n\":\"Late departure via Hong Kong\",\"v\":\"This single-award itinerary on the SFO–Hong Kong–Bangkok route reports 65,000 Aeroplan points and CAD 10,740 in minor currency units (CAD 107.40), with two seats reported. Its January 17 arrival and shorter elapsed time are useful; the tradeoff is that it leaves late on January 15, and the points’ price scope is unknown.\"},{\"k\":\"a\",\"r\":\"J19@2027-01-15T11:45-08:00/SFO>BKK/E>2027-01-17T00:15\",\"n\":\"Earlier-arriving Hong Kong alternative\",\"v\":\"Also via Hong Kong on a single Aeroplan award, this reports the same 65,000 points, six seats, and CAD 10,740 in minor units. It arrives 10 hours 20 minutes before the late-departure choice, but takes 70 minutes longer and leaves much earlier. It may suit you if an earlier Bangkok arrival matters more than the shorter journey.\"},{\"k\":\"b\",\"r\":\"C3@2027-01-15T08:51-08:00/SFO>BKK\",\"n\":\"Cash-search baseline\",\"v\":\"The search returned USD 456 for a two-stop itinerary via LAX and NRT, arriving January 16. Its price scope is unknown, so treat this as context—not a per-traveler or all-in price, or a like-for-like comparison with an award.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"Award prices and seat counts are reported search results, not confirmed bookings; award price scope is unknown, and the reported cabin does not establish every leg’s cabin. The cash quote’s scope is also unknown. Provider coverage was partial, some results may not be real-time, and the cash itinerary differs in route and arrival date. Check current availability, full itinerary details, and prices with the booking providers before deciding.\"}]}"
